Z||000005||pHoOl||09-07-2000||05:51 PM||||I'd have to disagree.  I think the point of having cool rims is so that they can be shown off.  The black ones in the picture blend in with the tires.  For that matter you could have any rims, even the dorky ones that they give you on Sunfires without the wheel covers.  I'd say the orange looks cool.  Body color stands out, but doesn't draw too much attention, such as chrome or bright as the sun yellow.  <P>Just my two cents<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
